  "label": "User projected onto the man in the fedora",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the fedora (man_in_fedora) as the focal point of the meme's ironic contrast. The user identifies with or imagines themselves as the unimpressed observer in the bottom panel, contrasting with the violent scene above. This projection is implicit, not explicit, but is a core part of the meme's humor and intent — the user is meant to see themselves as the calm, detached figure reacting to the chaos. The text 'gangster gettig shot' reinforces this by labeling the violent scene, making the user's imagined reaction (the man in the fedora) the central point of identification.",
